{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#card-zh","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd 是一款 DSH 工具插件：通过工具调用检查 systemd 用户会话、列出服务、查看单元状态并读取近期日志。它将 systemd --user 的只读查询接入 DSH，并在系统提示中说明可用范围。主要功能包括检查 systemctl 与 journalctl、列出服务单元、查询指定单元属性、读取指定单元日志。适合在 WSL 等 Linux 用户会话中查看 Ollama 等服务的运行情况。需要本机提供 systemctl、journalctl 和可访问的用户会话；不需要 API 密钥或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-22","index.js:34-48","index.js:52-76","lib/systemd.js:48-68","lib/systemd.js:71-109"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#card-en","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd adds read-only systemd --user tools to DSH. It checks command and session availability, lists services, shows unit state, and reads recent logs. Use it to inspect services such as Ollama in WSL or Linux. The host needs systemctl and journalctl; no API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-22","index.js:34-48","index.js:52-76","lib/systemd.js:48-68","lib/systemd.js:71-109"]}
