{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#feature-1","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd 的功能「检查环境」：探测 systemctl、journalctl 和用户总线是否可用。调用 systemd_status 后返回命令位置、XDG_RUNTIME_DIR 与会话状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:20-32","lib/systemd.js:48-68"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#feature-2","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd 的功能「列出用户服务」：列出当前用户的全部 service 单元。调用 systemd_user_list 工具触发，输出受长度上限保护的 systemctl 结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-50","lib/systemd.js:71-80"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#feature-3","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd 的功能「查看单元详情」：查询指定用户单元的活动状态、子状态、主进程号和单元文件路径。调用 systemd_user_show 并提供单元名触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:52-68","lib/systemd.js:14-20","lib/systemd.js:82-97"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#feature-4","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd 的功能「读取近期日志」：获取指定用户单元最近的日志行，默认 50 行且最多 200 行。使用 systemd_user_journal 或 journal_tail 并传入单元名触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:70-105","lib/systemd.js:99-110"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-systemd#caveat-1","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-systemd","commit":"de975a19e13638bd584f385ca65a2f1111b09021","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-systemd 使用前须知：需本机 systemctl、journalctl 和可用用户会话；仅查询状态与日志，不支持启停服务（见 lib/systemd.js:48-68,71-109）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/systemd.js:48-68","lib/systemd.js:71-109"]}
